{"metadata":{"title":[{"Plain":"*-代数"},2],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"slug":[{"Plain":"星代数"},0],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1]},"content":{"Plain":"\n<p>一个 *-代数是一个交换 (或非交换), 结合 (或非结合) 代数 $A$, 具有一个反对合 (anti-involution) $(-)^*\\colon A \\to A$, 满足</p>\n<ul>\n<li>$(ab)^* = b^* a^*$,</li>\n<li>$(a^*)^* = a$,</li>\n<li>$1^*=1$.</li>\n</ul>\n"}}